   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "A complete weighted graph has vertices <i>V</i>, <i>W</i>, <i>X</i>, <i>Y</i>, and <i>Z</i>. List all the distinct Hamilton cycles. Use <i>V</i> as the starting vertex. Identify the pairs of cycles that have the same weight because they are reverses of each other.",
